<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57-1/4 (FIM 265.55).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57-1/4 (FIM 265.55).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR rose $1-1/8 to end at $57-1/4 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 265.55 markka. In Helsinki on Monday Nokia A closed up 4.50 markka at 262.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) rose $0-3/8 to $34-1/8 on Wall Street on Tuesday. The price equals about 79.15 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 1.50 at 80.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR rose $0-1/2 to $19 in New York, which corresponds to about 88.15 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma rose 0.50 to 89.50 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235 (c) Reuters Limited 1996</p>
